station-event-deathsquad-enroute = All contracts terminated. Security forces were asked to lay down their arms, as were retired military personnel. That is why the death penalty is imposed. For example, the first command should be on the first line.
station-event-emergencyresponseteam-generic-enroute = Emergency Response Team, Nanotrace.
station-event-cburn-enroute = CBURN ERT dispatched in emergency or life-threatening situations. Workers were ordered to stay away from others and medical staff were ordered to lock their doors until supervisors and ERT members were notified. Workers and cleaners must wear protective clothing, shields and gloves to prevent the spread of the virus.
station-event-emergencyresponseteam-engineering-enroute = We are aware of outstanding parking issues. The job of an ERT engineer is to solve problems, an ERT engineer is more of a problem solver than a crew member or captain.
station-event-emergencyresponseteam-security-enroute = Salas believes an ERT team of 5 people is sufficient. The process is set to make the ART contestants the first winners of the Bigg Boss title. All officers must be prepared to respond to threats and use ERT and civilian systems.
station-event-emergencyresponseteam-medical-enroute =  ERT is considered medically necessary. The composition of the medical team has changed, the members of the ERT have become doctors and healthcare managers. ERT and doctors are encouraged to cooperate. In serious or emergency situations, a hospital emergency physician is required.
station-event-emergencyresponseteam-chaplain-enroute = This station has several emergency response teams. Special security forces were established.
